  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 4470 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for our droperidol product lists Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 876911 of that plant ended on 2014-03-28 and was classified OAI with six observations including absence of written procedures and deviations from laboratory control requirements.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2015, 2016, 2020, and 2023 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification occurred 4470 days before the posting date.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 9 days of inventory on hand and Corvale General has 13 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "American Regent, Inc. is an alternative supplier whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2024-04-24 and is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    }
  ]
}
